# Configuration for scx.service (shipped by scx-scheds; overrides the package default).
# scx_lavd (latency-aware) keeps niri/Zed smooth under heavy Stata/LLM load on the
# 16-core dual-CCD CPU (<1% penalty to the background job). See hardware note section 7.
# --autopower: picks performance/balanced/powersave from the system power profile.
#
# The old scx_loader/scxctl D-Bus loader was dropped by the scx COPR in 1.1.4.
# Change live:  sudo systemctl edit/restart scx.service, or `scxcli` for one-offs.
# Check active: cat /sys/kernel/sched_ext/root/ops
SCX_SCHEDULER=scx_lavd
SCX_FLAGS='--autopower'
